### 변수 설정
@host = http://localhost:8080

### 1. 좋아요 추가 (이벤트 발행)
#POST {{host}}/api/v1/like/products/1
#X-USER-ID: user123
#Content-Type: application/json
#
#### 2. 좋아요 제거
#DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/like/products/1
#X-USER-ID: user123
#Content-Type: application/json
#
#### 3. 좋아요 목록 조회
#GET {{host}}/api/v1/like/products?page=0&size=10
#X-USER-ID: user123

### 4. 주문 생성 API 호출

POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders
X-USER-ID: user123
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 10,
  "quantity": 1,
  "receiverName": "홍길동",
  "receiverPhone": "010-1234-5678",
  "receiverZipCode": "12345",
  "receiverAddress": "서울시 강남구",
  "receiverAddressDetail": "아파트 101동",
  "pointToUse": 0
}

### 5. 결제 API 호출
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/payments
X-USER-ID: user123
Content-Type: application/json

{
"orderId": 100008,
"paymentMethod": "PG",
"amount": 27500,
"cardType": "SAMSUNG",
"cardNo": "1234-5678-9012-3456"
}